    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make music with guns and guts!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/6f04237298cfce9adf61ce8f6a691c7b.poster.avif?t=1753175960\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/6f04237298cfce9adf61ce8f6a691c7b.webm?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/6f04237298cfce9adf61ce8f6a691c7b.mp4?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, reload, and kill to the beat in this fast-paced roguelike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/7fc161bb125adf1a675a73aba317585c.poster.avif?t=1753175960\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/7fc161bb125adf1a675a73aba317585c.webm?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/7fc161bb125adf1a675a73aba317585c.mp4?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful item synergies and craft unique builds to turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/b87076bba3cad3c8855dc4557b8f4254.poster.avif?t=1753175960\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/b87076bba3cad3c8855dc4557b8f4254.webm?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/b87076bba3cad3c8855dc4557b8f4254.mp4?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on challenging trials to unlock powerful active items, like the <strong>Meathook</strong>, which lets you swing into enemies with deadly force, or <strong>C4</strong>, perfect for blowing them to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alternate soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/834d8b113d0676fa56975c19600fef90.poster.avif?t=1753175960\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/834d8b113d0676fa56975c19600fef90.webm?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/834d8b113d0676fa56975c19600fef90.mp4?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the game on Hardmode to unlock a faster and more intense alternate soundtrack. Want more? Import your own custom songs and crank up the chaos</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make music with guns and guts!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/6f04237298cfce9adf61ce8f6a691c7b.poster.avif?t=1753175960\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/6f04237298cfce9adf61ce8f6a691c7b.webm?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/6f04237298cfce9adf61ce8f6a691c7b.mp4?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, reload, and kill to the beat in this fast-paced roguelike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create builds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/7fc161bb125adf1a675a73aba317585c.poster.avif?t=1753175960\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/7fc161bb125adf1a675a73aba317585c.webm?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/7fc161bb125adf1a675a73aba317585c.mp4?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful item synergies and craft unique builds to turn the tide in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Trials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/b87076bba3cad3c8855dc4557b8f4254.poster.avif?t=1753175960\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/b87076bba3cad3c8855dc4557b8f4254.webm?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/b87076bba3cad3c8855dc4557b8f4254.mp4?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on challenging trials to unlock powerful active items, like the <strong>Meathook</strong>, which lets you swing into enemies with deadly force, or <strong>C4</strong>, perfect for blowing them to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alternate soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/834d8b113d0676fa56975c19600fef90.poster.avif?t=1753175960\" width=616 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/834d8b113d0676fa56975c19600fef90.webm?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2808530/extras/834d8b113d0676fa56975c19600fef90.mp4?t=1753175960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat the game on Hardmode to unlock a faster and more intense alternate soundtrack. Want more? Import your own custom songs and crank up the chaos</p>",
